WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.720
I recommit my life to you as best I can, and if I've fallen short in making that commitment,

2
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:14.000
you take it. Do you hear me? If I've fallen short in making that surrender, Father, I authorize you,

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:25.360
you take over my life, and he'll do it. It's an interesting phenomenon that churches always

4
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:30.880
wait for the preacher to make an appeal. There are some people who will never come to Christ

5
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:36.000
unless the preacher has come. Now, if you're convicted now, why are you waiting for me to

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.520
make an appeal? You should stand and say, Pastor, I heard you. I'm going to forgive somebody. Or you

7
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:49.760
should say, this thing has moved me. I am going to take a closer look at me and take a vacation

8
00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:56.880
from watching others. Who wants to make a commitment tonight? All right. What commitment?
